-warning w-100 mb-3">Mulai Pengujian</button></form>@endif @if($testingRequest->status==='testing')<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><h5>Selesaikan Pengujian</h5><form method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="{{ route('tenaga-labor.tests.complete',$testingRequest) }}">@csrf<input class="form-control mb-2" name="letter_number" placeholder="Nomor surat hasil" required><textarea class="form-control mb-2" name="result_summary" placeholder="Ringkasan hasil" required></textarea><label class="form-label small">PDF hasil (opsional)</label><input type="file" class="form-control mb-2" name="result_file" accept=".pdf"><button class="btn btn-success">Selesai & Terbitkan Hasil</button></form></div></div>@endif</div></div></div>@endsection